        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wernher von Braun\n- Products: V-2 rocket, Saturn V, communication satellite\n- Organizations: U.S. Army\n- Programs: U.S. Army satellite program\n- Dates: April 6, 1967\n\nFacts:\n- Wernher von Braun was a German engineer credited with inventing the V-2 rocket and the Saturn V.\n- Wernher von Braun was also a supervisor in the U.S. Army satellite program.\n- The U.S. Army satellite program launched a communication satellite on April 6, 1967.",
